Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this bundle (run_all.py
and src/) and to the files the code generates (results/ and figures/).

It does not apply to the third-party input data in data/:
  * data/zurich_electricity_consumption.csv contains open government data of
    the City of Zurich (weather station Stampfenbachstrasse, Umwelt- und
    Gesundheitsschutz Zurich; electricity delivered by grid level, ewz), as
    distributed with the darts library (https://github.com/unit8co/darts).
    It remains subject to the terms of use stated by the City of Zurich
    (https://data.stadt-zuerich.ch).
  * data/household_load_15min.csv is generated by src/gen_household_load.py
    with richardsonpy and is covered by the MIT licence above.
